                "firstPurchaseSection": {
                    "title": "IS THIS YOUR FIRST BELLA VITA PURCHASE?",
                    "paragraphs": [
                        "We’ve all had the experience of seeing ads that promise the world, bought it, and realised it wasn’t quite as advertised. That’s no good. We at BELLAVITA take a different approach before launching any perfume:",
                        "In-Depth Consumer Research: Each of our perfumes is backed by hundreds of days of comprehensive consumer research, tailoring scents to meet the genuine needs and preferences of the Indian consumer while keeping in mind the Indian climate.",
                        "Superior Ingredients: We source our premium ingredients from France, Spain, and Italy, known world-over for their quality and uniqueness in fragrance.",
                        "Proven Longevity: Our perfumes are designed to last, offering 8 to 10 hours of enduring scent, ensuring you stay fresh throughout the day.",
                        "IFRA Certification: Commitment to safety and quality is paramount and so all our perfumes are IFRA-certified, meeting rigorous international standards, making them safe to use on skin."
                    ],
                    "images": [
                        "/img/productDetails/BellvitaProductOne.png",
                        "/img/productDetails/BellvitaProductTwo.png",
                        "/img/productDetails/BellvitaProductThree.png",
                        "/img/productDetails/BellvitaProductFour.png"
                    ],
                    "footerText": "Still not convinced? If you’re still not sure what you are looking for, you can try our perfume trial pack, which offers you the chance to try out our 10 perfumes at just ₹349!"
                },
                "faq": [
                    {
                        "q": "CEO Man Luxury perfume is long lasting?",
                        "a": "Yes, the CEO Man Luxury perfume lasts up to 8 hours. As a result, you won’t experience any long-lasting problems with our perfumes, which were carefully formulated for the Indian climate."
                    },
                    {
                        "q": "Is there any side effect of perfumes?",
                        "a": "Our perfumes are created for sensitive skin so that everyone can smell and feel good due to which there are no side effects."
                    },
                    {
                        "q": "How can I use perfume safely?",
                        "a": "Apply moisturiser and then spray the perfume on your skin."
                    },
                    {
                        "q": "What are the main notes in CEO Man Perfume?",
                        "a": "CEO Man Perfume has top notes of Lemon and Sugar with Lavender in the medium and Vetiver, Moss and Tonka at its base."
                    },
                    {
                        "q": "",
                        "a": "The perfume lasts longer and smells better overall when you moisturise your skin before applying it. On very dry skin, perfume often evaporates quickly. Instead, attempt misting it over a thin layer of fragrance-free body lotion or a dab of petroleum jelly. These moisturisers not only keep your skin supple and silky, but they also provide a surface for the perfume oils to cling to, extending the duration of your perfume."
                    }
                ],
